{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-43420-r4535145","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Veggie Salad","sourcePageId":43420,"sourceRevision":"4535145","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-09-01T23:40:05Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Veggie%20Salad&oldid=4535145","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:29:16.734Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Canadian recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for salad","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using celery","Category:Recipes using chive","Category:Recipes using green bean","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"a9255cc916d4d5fc89fd1dcd87d180d7a1b2d6717fc05e0c4b31bb13001c251e","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Salad recipes|time=30 minutes|difficulty=3}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Side dishes | Side dishes]] | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Canada | Canadian Cuisine]]\n\nThis '''veggie salad''' is a light vegetable salad with a dash of spice to it.\n== Ingredients ==\n\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (120 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n* ½ cup (120 g) [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Celery|celery]]\n* 1 cup (240 g) shredded [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrot]]\n* ½ (120 g) cup cubed [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomato]]\n* 4–6 chopped [[Cookbook:Green Beans|green beans]]\n* 4–6 chopped yellow beans\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Green Pepper|green pepper]]\n* 3 chopped [[Cookbook:Walnuts|walnuts]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] of fresh [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] of [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n* 1 teaspoon of [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n* ½ teaspoon of [[Cookbook:Chives|chives]]\n* ½ teaspoon of [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Cut the green pepper into long thin strips.\n# Toss vegetables together in a large bowl.\n# Using a [[Cookbook:Mortar and Pestle|mortar]], grind the spices together, and sprinkle over salad.\n# Sprinkle walnut chunks over salad.\n# Serve.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* One can easily substitute the cubes of tomato for cherry tomatoes or plum tomatoes, but these both contain seeds, and the bitterness is often undesirable.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Canadian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chive]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green bean]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Veggie Salad","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"½ cup (120 g) diced onion","sourceText":"½ cup (120 g) diced onion","amountText":"½ cup (120 g) diced onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ cup (120 g) chopped celery","sourceText":"½ cup (120 g) chopped celery","amountText":"½ cup (120 g) chopped celery","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 cup (240 g) shredded carrot","sourceText":"1 cup (240 g) shredded carrot","amountText":"1 cup (240 g) shredded carrot","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"½ (120 g)